    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"ExceptionTranslatorExecuteListener.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.jooq.autoconfigure\"><code>ExceptionTranslatorExecuteListener</code></a> backed by an\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/jdbc/support/SQLExceptionTranslator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.jdbc.support\"><code>SQLExceptionTranslator</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的由 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/jdbc/support/SQLExceptionTranslator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.jdbc.support\"><code>SQLExceptionTranslator</code></a>` 支持的、基于 <a href=\"ExceptionTranslatorExecuteListener.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.jooq.autoconfigure\"><code>ExceptionTranslatorExecuteListener</code></a>` 的实例。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Default <a href=\"ExceptionTranslatorExecuteListener.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.jooq.autoconfigure\"><code>ExceptionTranslatorExecuteListener</code></a> suitable for most applications.",
      "translation": "默认情况下，<a href=\"ExceptionTranslatorExecuteListener.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.jooq.autoconfigure\"><code>ExceptionTranslatorExecuteListener</code></a> 适用于大多数应用程序。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "An <code>ExecuteListener</code> used by the auto-configured\n<code>DefaultExecuteListenerProvider</code> to translate exceptions in the\n<code>ExecuteContext</code>. Most commonly used to translate <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java/sql/SQLException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.sql\"><code>SQLExceptions</code></a> to Spring-specific <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/dao/DataAccessException.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.dao\"><code>DataAccessExceptions</code></a> by\nadapting an existing <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/jdbc/support/SQLExceptionTranslator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.jdbc.support\"><code>SQLExceptionTranslator</code></a>.",
      "translation": "由自动配置的 <code>DefaultExecuteListenerProvider</code> 使用的 <code>ExecuteListener</code>，用于转换 <code>ExecuteContext</code> 中的异常。通常用于将 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java/sql/SQLException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.sql\"><code>SQLExceptions</code></a> 转换为 Spring 特定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/dao/DataAccessException.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.dao\"><code>DataAccessExceptions</code></a>，方法是适配现有的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/jdbc/support/SQLExceptionTranslator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.jdbc.support\"><code>SQLExceptionTranslator</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>translatorFactory</code> - factory function used to create the\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/jdbc/support/SQLExceptionTranslator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.jdbc.support\"><code>SQLExceptionTranslator</code></a>",
      "translation": "<code>translatorFactory</code> - 用于创建 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/jdbc/support/SQLExceptionTranslator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.jdbc.support\"><code>SQLExceptionTranslator</code></a> 的工厂函数",
      "count": 2
    },
